			<div class="content" id="post-content-2448119">
									

<p>I think because it grows things really REALLY well, it makes human fetuses into things that are EXTRA-human, (plus, imagine a fully-grown human being with no exposure whatsoever to other people at any time, made extra strong and smart and healthy. You know those Russian babies that got adopted as toddlers and they were totally antisocial and dangerous as children? Multiply that by 10.) and the fly larva as EXTRA-fly. So, really horrible and disgusting, presumably with fewer limitations (like book lung capacity/effectiveness, thereby tweaking how big the fly can get) and higher sensitivity to movement around it.</p>
<p>But dog just gives you dog. More dog. Extra dog. Very Good Dog.</p>

